{
  "key": "letter-044-part-01",
  "number": 44,
  "generationId": "01a1e4f0-6499-76a6-a1f9-1c13d3fad6bb",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.52288
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "What gift is greater than love?",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.7893880000000002,
      "end": 3.490635
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "And still you ask - What have I given?",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/03.mp3",
      "start": 4.737211,
      "end": 7.599365
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Oh, mad one!",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/04.mp3",
      "start": 8.833605,
      "end": 9.945782
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "When love is given there is nothing left to give, not even the giver, for to give love is to give oneself.",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/05.mp3",
      "start": 11.235215,
      "end": 16.362222000000003
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "You have given yourself, now where are you?",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/06.mp3",
      "start": 17.623469,
      "end": 20.059365
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Having lost yourself, now you are bound to find the one you have been longing to meet.",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/07.mp3",
      "start": 21.285646,
      "end": 26.467846
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Now she has been born, and I am a witness to it, I have watched it happen.",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/08.mp3",
      "start": 27.837211,
      "end": 32.926916
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "I can hear the music that you are going to be.",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/09.mp3",
      "start": 34.237619,
      "end": 36.653878
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "The other day, when your heart was close to me, I heard it.",
      "path": "audio/1967-44/10.mp3",
      "start": 38.047007,
      "end": 41.93
    }
  ]
}
